{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美軍航母林肯號預計明日停靠泰國度假勝地芭堤雅附近港口。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芭堤雅市面見到有歡迎美軍的橫額。泰國官員稱，林肯號結束中東長期部署後，連同兩艘軍艦周三將停靠芭堤雅附近港口。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.PREP-1830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026s1MrhsQfBG1788261696.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.THAI.PREP-1830_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有報道稱，警方正準備在主要海灘和夜生活區域加強巡邏，又引述市長稱希望此次停靠提振當地經濟，有官員警告商家不可向美國官兵收取過高費用。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.PREP-1830_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026YVxirBWpyx1788256546.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.THAI.PREP-1830_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">林肯號上月22日離開中東，艦上約5,000名官兵，有望結束連續逾270天海上部署。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T11:40:04.663953+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}